"Specific, daily and weekly reminders delivered to Telegram and your browser.": "Specific date, daily aur weekly reminders, seedha Telegram aur aapke browser par.",
"What is Deadline?": "Deadline kya hai?",
"Deadline sends you reminders at the right time: a specific date and time, every day, or on chosen days every week. Add assignments, projects, exams, habits or routines, and we remind you through Telegram and browser notifications.": "Deadline sahi time par aapko reminder bhejta hai: kisi specific date aur time par, har din, ya har hafte chune hue dino par. Assignments, projects, exams, habits ya routines add karo, aur hum aapko Telegram aur browser notifications se yaad dilayenge.",
"Is this application free to use?": "Kya ye app free hai?",
"Yes! Task tracking, Magic Add, Telegram alerts, browser notifications and syncing across devices are all completely free.": "Haan! Task tracking, Magic Add, Telegram alerts, browser notifications aur devices ke beech sync, sab kuch bilkul free hai.",
"Can I install it like an app on my phone?": "Kya main ise phone mein app ki tarah install kar sakta/sakti hoon?",
"Yes. Deadline is a web app that you can add to your home screen, so it opens full-screen like a normal app.": "Haan. Deadline ek web app hai jise aap home screen par add kar sakte ho, phir ye normal app ki tarah full screen mein khulta hai.",
"Android (Chrome): tap the ⋮ menu, then \"Install app\" or \"Add to Home screen\".": "Android (Chrome): ⋮ menu par tap karo, phir \"Install app\" ya \"Add to Home screen\".",
